{"title":"EVOC Bikepacking Gets Storage Upgrade in New 9-15L Seat Pack BOA WP Bags","link":"https://bikerumor.com/evoc-bikepacking-gets-storage-upgrade-in-new-9-15l-seat-pack-boa-wp-bags/","date":1794594045000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_big-one-loaded-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags\" /></p>\n<p>EVOC has been making Boa-equipped bikepacking bags <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/evoc-gives-bikepacking-bags-a-twist-with-boa-fit-system-for-handlebars-seat-posts/\" target=\"_blank\">since 2019</a>. Sure, they first <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/review-evoc-bikepacking-packs-dial-in-secure-compact-storage-for-mini-off-road-adventure-rides/\" target=\"_blank\">started very small</a>, but EVOC soon expanded <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/evoc-bikepacking-bags-go-big-for-versatility-commuter-air-airbag-backpack-gets-real/\" target=\"_blank\">to haul more gear</a>, too. We got a preview of the expanded, more boxy Explorer range this past <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/zachs-sea-otter-randoms-a-pregnant-rim-blue-ponds-performance-enhancing-sunscreen-more/\" target=\"_blank\">spring</a> and <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/load-up-and-roll-out-with-evocs-new-bikepacking-collection/\" target=\"_blank\">summer</a>. But now that you can actually buy it, let’s dive into the details of the Seat Pack Boa WP that forms the “heart” of their bikepacking family.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9, 12 &amp; 15L bikepacking bags </h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: Katharina Kruse packs a bag\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse_pack-your-bags-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(Adventure photos by Katharina Kruse/EVOC)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new EVOC Seat Pack Boa WP bags are the biggest volume storage option in the brand’s bikepacking line-up. But they also tend to be the most adaptable, since you can roll them down quite far for smaller loads. And their latest adaptation of Boa wire &amp; dial tensioning is easier than ever to really fine-tune a secure fit on your bike, helping prevent the dreaded saddlebag sway, no matter if your pack is half-empty or overstuffed.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>What’s new?</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle.jpg\"><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: new V-shaped seatpost cradle\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle.jpg 1600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_new-v-shaped-seatpost-cradle-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Seat Pack features EVOC’s latest waterproof, PFAS-free material with heat-welded seams. They also get a new V-shaped mount that keys against your seatpost to provide a more secure attachment, preventing side-to-side sway. Still, the mount is quite short in height on the post, which EVOC explains makes it possible to mount the new bags even on MTB dropper posts while retaining some drop capability. And also helps on smaller bikes with bigger wheels where there’s often not a lot of clearance between the saddle and rear tire.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: reinforced sides\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_reinforced-sides-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>They also feature new reinforced side panels to provide structure and help retain the bag’s shape keep the bag in shape when you cinch down your gear. The new, more boxy-shape also makes it easier to stuff your gear deep and low in the bag, notoriously the most important step in packing a bikepacking saddlebag to minimize sway.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Tech details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: in off-white Sand or Black\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-2048x1229.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_black-or-sand-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>dual BOA wire fit systems with TPU straps to easily dial-in a secure connection to saddle rails</li>\n\n\n\n<li>V-shaped plastic seatpost mount with rubber gripper for secure, stable attachment</li>\n\n\n\n<li>WP stands for waterproof with new PFAS-free, PVC-free 100% polyester fabric</li>\n\n\n\n<li>waterproof roll-top closure with side buckles to adjust total volume</li>\n\n\n\n<li>removable zigzag bungee loops on top to stow more gear</li>\n\n\n\n<li>reflective details for visibility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>2-position taillight attachment lashing point</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: correct dimensions\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-297x149.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-1536x768.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-120x60.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-768x384.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-2048x1024.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-12L-15L-bikepacking-bags_seatpack-dimensions-corrected-1600x800.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>BOA 9L dimensions: 19×45×15cm, 530g</li>\n\n\n\n<li>BOA 12L dimensions: 20×50×17cm, 570g</li>\n\n\n\n<li>BOA 15L dimensions: 21×56×17cm, 600g<br /><em>(Note: EVOC website illustrations do NOT have the correct dimensions.)</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP – Pricing, options &amp; availability</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: 9L Black\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-9L-bikepacking-bag-in-Black_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(Photo Philipp Herfort/EVOC)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Forming the core gear carrying capacity of the <a href=\"https://evocsports.com/collections/bike-packing\" target=\"_blank\">entire EVOC bikepacking range</a>, the new Seat Pack Boa WP comes in three sizes and two colors. Pick from 9L, 12L &amp; 15L, in classic Black or off-white Sand. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: 15L Sand\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag-in-off-white-Sand_photo-by-Philipp-Herfort-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(Photo Philipp Herfort/EVOC)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The 9L Boa bag sells for $175 / 130€, the 12L Boa for $200 / 150€, and the 15L Boa for $215 / 170€.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>There’s also a simpler, smaller 7L Seat Pack Ultra that replaces the nice Boa system for bikepacking weight weenies at $150 / 95€.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure.jpg\"><img width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure.jpg\" alt=\"EVOC Seat Pack BOA WP 9L, 12L &amp; 15L waterproof Boa-dial fit bikepacking bags: Katharina Kruse loaded u pfor adventure\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure.jpg 1600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EVOC-Seat-Pack-BOA-WP-15L-bikepacking-bag_Katharina-Kruse-loaded-up-for-adventure-1200x675.jpg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Get all of them now to head out on an adventure, directly from EVOC or their dealer bike shops.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://evocsports.com/\" target=\"_blank\">EVOCsports.com</a></p>","author":"Cory Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/evoc-bikepacking-gets-storage-upgrade-in-new-9-15l-seat-pack-boa-wp-bags/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"6e99595a5df31ac9c97457ccf666248cdb5ee688b4b2498239138975a0414f6d","category":"Cycling"}